4. ATTRIBUTION FORMAT

   The attribution must be clear, visible, and accessible to end users.
   Acceptable formats include (but are not limited to):

   Short form (for UI, API responses, footers):
       "Powered by Nexus Coder by Hieu Louis"

   Medium form (for README, docs):
       "Built using Nexus Coder by Hieu Louis
        (https://github.com/mhieuhonda/NexusCoder)"

   Full form (for model cards, academic publications):
       "This work is based on Nexus Coder (v0.4.0, CyberForge Edition),
        created by Hieu Louis (https://github.com/mhieuhonda/NexusCoder)
        and licensed under NAL-1.0."

